abstract: >-
  Data and code for a conjugate CFD study of steady and pulsed dielectric-fluid
  flow in single-phase immersion cooling of a six-cell 18650 lithium-ion module
  (HFE-7200, closed housing, 3C discharge of 900 s), compared at matched pump
  energy. OpenFOAM v2606 chtMultiRegionFoam, laminar, variable properties.
  Contains the 14 scored cases (OpenFOAM setup files, all monitor series and a
  slim solver-log extract per case), the results table, the per-case numerical
  checks, derived temperature histories, the scripts that regenerate the
  results table, the checks and the paper's figures from the case archives, and
  the generator modules that re-create each case's OpenFOAM setup.
  Code: MIT; data and documentation: CC BY 4.0.
